{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"better\": \"Y\",\n  \"regress\": \"有：Y在S06、S11等段落把水纹、初恋、旧房子等意象叠得较密，偶尔会让感受意象抢过人物当下的心理动作，X反而更直接。\",\n  \"nets\": {\n    \"scan\": \"Y\",\n    \"point\": \"Y\",\n    \"why\": \"Y\",\n    \"whole\": \"Y\",\n    \"fine\": \"Y\"\n  },\n  \"why\": \"Y的加亮短语让我能迅速抓住每段人物心理的关键转折，小字感受又提供了第二层信息，不必逐字读完也能跟上。更重要的是，人物从害怕暴露需要、发现对方没有退开、逐渐相信彼此可能互相需要，到接受无法保证永远、决定不再隐藏喜欢，前后因果比较清楚；音乐感受也有具体的声音、身体和时间变化，且部分内容跟随乐句出现，细腻程度更高。X的完整叙述并不差，但右侧短词与左侧人物心理的对应关系较松，容易读到气氛却抓不准这一段究竟推进了什么。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "74fa3b77-f608-4525-8da0-4c34ea2ab8ea", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt4\\pro-bridge-20261108T011451537848Z", "elapsed_seconds": 48.875, "completed_utc": "2026-11-08T01:15:40.414047+00:00", "model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "32bc3977e2ee58c8c77ae9a479b80b1c7b8824ad868f67e2dba1f7740fa1755b", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "Nozomi Kasaki / gpt4", "account_sha256": "bbd4fd636d4b6714d2b42b89e341bdb5bbe7c34f7d141aec76b444be8343fe54", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb